   express the fact: that `runsVersionFilter` is gone from this specific
   source file (not just absent from one page for unrelated reasons), and
   that the analytics modal's markup lives in `dtwin.html` itself rather
   than in the partial — a structural fact about which file contains what,
   since the merged rendered response cannot distinguish a page-level modal
   in `dtwin.html` from one that leaked into the partial (which `domain.html`
   also includes today; a later task removes that inclusion, not this one).

