the Digital Twin page's menu declares `runs`. Two more dead references
surfaced during review of the earlier tasks: a stale `#runsVersionFilter`
selector in `permissions.css` left over from the version dropdown Task 3
removed, and unconsumed `current_version` / `versions` fields in the
